cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "bci-membrane-latch: a toy fail-closed OES-32 residual gate between simulated EEG quality and hologram intents"
abstract: >-
  Toy simulation (SYNTHETIC data only) of a fail-closed latch that fires one of four hologram UI
  intents only when the OES-32 residual R = max|x - x_ref| is within tolerance and a stub decoder
  is confident. Not a medical device, not a clinical BCI decoder, no real EEG.
type: software
